# Dev-only project written by `quarp new` next to a cartridge. It holds ABSOLUTE paths to
# the Quarp tools on the machine that generated it, so committing one would point every
# other checkout at a drive that does not exist. Regenerate it with `quarp new` instead.
.quarp/

